        "original_id": "3efdda65-f2ed-558e-b8b7-8424f9000890",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Judas Priest\n- Products: \"Heading Out to the Highway\", Point of Entry, Hero, Hero\n- Companies: Gull Records\n- Topics: album releases, compilation albums, heavy metal\n\nFacts:\n- Judas Priest released \"British Steel\" in 1980.\n- Gull Records released Hero, Hero, a compilation album of early Judas Priest recordings, between Judas Priest's 1980 album \"British Steel\" and their 1981 album Point of Entry.\n- Point of Entry is the seventh album by the British heavy metal band Judas Priest.\n- Point of Entry was released on 26 February 1981.\n- \"Heading Out to the Highway\" is a song by the British heavy metal band Judas Priest from their 1981 album Point of Entry.",
